    "detailed_description": "<span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2638100/extras/8bb940963092f110672ff5213039bbc1.avif?t=1745556856\" width=600 height=338 /></span><br><br><strong>Fresh Story</strong> is a visual novel about one girl's difficult journey. She will face difficulties and hard decisions to achieve a peaceful life as she dreamed.<br>Diana came from the suburbs to the big city to achieve success and a happy life with her boyfriend Archie. But can they get through all the temptations and stay true to each other?<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2638100/extras/93c72de43cb3f64437184d18bef3b26f.avif?t=1745556856\" width=600 height=338 /></span><br><br>You will make decisions that will affect her level of debauchery and relationships with different people. <br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2638100/extras/5b5966ec05b7802ec334e337f43ef3fd.poster.avif?t=1745556856\" width=600 height=338 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2638100/extras/5b5966ec05b7802ec334e337f43ef3fd.webm?t=1745556856\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2638100/extras/5b5966ec05b7802ec334e337f43ef3fd.mp4?t=1745556856\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br><br>Immerse her in the pleasures of the big city, or keep her chaste for her lover.<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2638100/extras/f2b1307b06bfef576d83412c042114d4.poster.avif?t=1745556856\" width=600 height=338 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_asset